Description: Keep eye corrections in Gwenview per-file configuration
 Navigation and restart restore the selected file's correction and checkbox.
 Legacy attributes are read as defaults, and neither the image nor its attributes
 are written by the correction action.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Last-Update: 2026-10-23
Forwarded: no

